{block content}
<div class="row g-4">
    <section class="col-lg-7"><h1>About Playlog</h1><p class="lead">A small space for a simple hobby: finding a good game and making time to enjoy it.</p><p>Playlog brings together a game catalogue, short notes and a personal session planner. It is a student project about gaming, with no account to create and no public player profile.</p><h2 class="h4 mt-4">Take a look around</h2><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item px-0">Browse <a n:href="games">60 games</a> and find a familiar favourite or something new.</li><li class="list-group-item px-0">Read <a n:href="reviews">short game notes</a> without story spoilers.</li><li class="list-group-item px-0">Compare <a n:href="genres">different kinds of games</a> for different moods.</li><li class="list-group-item px-0">Use the <a n:href="planner">Play Planner</a> to choose a game and a manageable goal.</li></ul></section>
    <aside class="col-lg-5"><div class="card"><div class="card-body"><h2 class="h5">Small plans, no pressure.</h2><p class="text-body-secondary">You do not need to finish a whole game in a weekend. A puzzle, a quest or one more run can be a complete evening.</p><a n:href="planner" class="btn btn-success">Make a plan</a></div></div></aside>
</div>
<section id="sources" class="border-top mt-5 pt-4"><h2 class="h4">Sources &amp; credits</h2><p class="small text-body-secondary">Game names, developer names and Steam release dates were collected from the official Steam Store on 10 November 2026. The catalogue is a fixed snapshot, not a live store. Links in each row lead to the original game page. Genres are simplified editorial categories; the notes are original project text.</p><p class="small text-body-secondary">Gameplay images are from the official store pages for <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/620/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Portal 2 (Valve)</a>, <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/1145360/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hades (Supergiant Games)</a> and <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/413150/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Stardew Valley (ConcernedApe)</a>. Game names and images belong to their respective owners.</p><p class="small text-body-secondary mb-0">Built for REWB at the University of Ostrava with <a href="https://nette.org/">Nette</a>, <a href="https://getbootstrap.com/">Bootstrap</a>, <a href="https://icons.getbootstrap.com/">Bootstrap Icons</a>, <a href="https://jquery.com/">jQuery</a> and <a href="https://datatables.net/">DataTables</a>.</p></section>
